- `S3InputStream.readTail` → `IOUtil.readRemaining(rangeStream, buffer, offset, length)`
- `ADLSInputStream.readTail` → `IOUtil.readRemaining(inputStream, buffer, offset, length)`

both of which loop. So GCS is the only one of the three that can return short, and
`RangeReadable.readTail` is documented as *"Read the last `length` bytes from the file"*.

